# Research & Publication Implementation Plan: Modular Frontier Pipelines

This plan specifies the architecture and implementation for the next research phase of **Aqua-Predict-NB**, structured as a **Unified Core with Modular Frontier Pipelines**. 

This architectural pattern eliminates redundant code while giving you complete research independence: each scientific frontier can be run, tuned, and plotted independently for its respective journal submission, while their combined outputs feed into a single, cohesive public health dashboard.

